              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Networks of legislation based on references from and/or to EU legislation. The files included are the edges lists that can be used to construct the networks referred to in the publication. The networks are titled N1-N5, with the numbering (1-5) following the one in the publication. The networks can, for instance, be created by importing the edges lists into Gephi. The Gephi file contains all networks, including the calculated network centrality measures (e.g. degree, in-degree) and the modularity of the communities."
                },
